        <p class="text-body">
          Water heating accounts for roughly 18 percent of domestic energy usage. Hybrid heat pump units capture ambient warmth, operating up to three times more efficiently than standard electric tanks.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-bento calc-strategy-card">
        <div class="text-overline text-accent-alpine">Building Envelope</div>
        <h3 class="text-widget-title">Attic &amp; Wall Insulation (R-49)</h3>
        <p class="text-body">
          Bringing attic insulation to Washington energy code levels prevents substantial thermal leakage. Utility square-footage incentives frequently offset 30 to 50 percent of total contractor costs.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="surface-bento calc-strategy-card">
